        "command": "for i in 1 2 3; do make test-parity || exit 1; done",
        "exit_code": 1,
        "evidence": [
          {
            "criterion": "Amended parity exception and exact command exit",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/watcher-fix/registered-coverage/parity-ci-1.log:2580"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Both assigned tests passed on first attempt",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/watcher-fix/registered-coverage/parity-1.junit.xml"
          },
          {
            "criterion": "Signed make land passed on origin/main",
            "reference": "/Users/feral/mydev/bbx-gate-repairs/target/fixture-handoff/watcher-fix/registered-coverage/mux-land.log"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
    ```
    """

